<InfoPage
	title="About YBS"
	description="Learn why YBS provides fast, focused, and privacy-conscious browser utilities."
	canonicalPath="/about"
>
	<h2>Simple tools for everyday work</h2>
	<p>YBS (Your Browser Suite) is a growing collection of free browser-based utilities for writing, structured data, encoding, and other common tasks. Each tool is designed to provide a clear result without requiring an account or unnecessary setup.</p>

	<h2>Local-first processing</h2>
	<p>Where a tool states that processing happens locally, its input is handled by code running in your browser rather than being sent to a YBS application server. Normal website requests may still create standard hosting and security logs.</p>

	<h2>How we build</h2>
	<p>YBS uses static pages and native browser capabilities to keep the experience fast and dependable. New tools are added when they solve a focused problem and can provide predictable results.</p>
</InfoPage>
